      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material via deictic reference",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'did you?' which uses the deictic pronoun 'you', directly addressing the viewer and inviting them to participate in the absurd scenario. This creates an interactive projection where the user is positioned as the one who might have 'done nazi that bird fly by', thereby implicating them in the meme's surreal and offensive premise.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
